[374.924482, "o", "     1\t=== sample_001.png ===\r\n     2\tWest of House Score: 0 Moves: 0\r\n     3\tZORK I: The Great Underground Empire\r\n     4\t\r\n     5\tCopyright (c) 1981, 1982, 1983 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\n     6\t\r\n     7\tZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\r\n     8\t\r\n     9\tRevision 88 7 Serial number 840726\r\n    10\t\r\n    11\tWest of House\r\n    12\t\r\n    13\tYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\n    14\tdoor.\r\n    15\t\r\n    16\tThere is a small mailbox here.\r\n    17\t\r\n    18\ta\r\n    19\t\r\n    20\t=== sample_002.png ===\r\n    21\tWest of House Score: 0 Moves: 0\r\n    22\tZORK I: The Great Underground Empire\r\n    23\t\r\n    24\tCopyright (c) 1981, 1982, 1983 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\n    25\t\r\n    26\tZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\r\n    27\t\r\n    28\tRevision 88 7 Serial number 840726\r\n    29\t\r\n    30\tWest of House\r\n    31\t\r\n    32\tYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\n    33\tdoor.\r\n    34\t\r\n    35\tThere is a small mailbox here.\r\n    36\t\r\n    37\tmm\r\n    38\t\r\n    39\t=== sample_003.png ===\r\n    40\t>n\r\n    41\t\r\n    42\tNorth of House\r\n    43\t\r\n    44\tYou are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all\r\n    45\tthe windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.\r\n    46\t>n\r\n    47\t\r\n    48\tForest Path\r\n    49\t\r\n    50\tThis is a path winding through a dimly lit forest. The path heads north-south\r\n    51\there. One particularly large tree with some low branches stands at the edge of\r\n    52\tthe path.\r\n    53\t\r\n    54\t>u\r\n    55\t\r\n    56\tUp a Tree\r\n    57\t\r\n    58\tYou are about 10 feet above the ground nestled among some large branches. The\r\n    59\tnearest branch above you is above your reach.\r\n    60\t\r\n    61\tBeside you on the branch is a small bird’s nest.\r\n    62\t\r\n    63\tIn the bird’s nest is a large egg encrusted with precious jewels, apparently\r\n    64\tscavenged by a childless songbird. The egg is covered with fine gold inlay,\r\n    65\tand ornamented in lapis lazuli and mother-of-pearl. Unlike most eggs, this one\r\n    66\tis hinged and closed with a delicate looking clasp. The egg appears extremely\r\n    67\tfragile.\r\n    68\t\r\n    69\t>get\r\n    70\t\r\n    71\t=== sample_004.png ===\r\n    72\tLiving Room Score: 15 Moves: 13\r\n    73\tA quantity of water\r\n    74\t\r\n    75\t>w\r\n    76\t\r\n    77\tLiving Room\r\n    78\t\r\n    79\tYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with\r\n    80\t\r\n    81\tstrange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a\r\n    82\t\r\n    83\ttrophy case, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\r\n    84\t\r\n    85\tAbove the trophy case hangs an elvish sword of great antiquity.\r\n    86\t\r\n    87\tA battery-powered brass lantern is on the trophy case.\r\n    88\t\r\n    89\t>get all\r\n    90\t\r\n    91\ttrophy case: The trophy case is securely fastened to the wall.\r\n    92\t\r\n    93\tsword: Taken.\r\n    94\t\r\n    95\tbrass lantern: Taken.\r\n    96\t\r\n    97\tcarpet: The rug is extremely heavy and cannot be carried.\r\n    98\t\r\n    99\t>move rug\r\n   100\t\r\n   101\tWith a great effort, the rug is moved to one side of the room, revealing the\r\n   102\t\r\n   103\tdusty cover of a closed trap door.\r\n   104\t\r\n   105\tDopen case\r\n   106\t\r\n   107\tOpened.\r\n   108\t\r\n   109\t>open tra\r\n   110\t\r\n   111\t=== sample_005.png ===\r\n   112\t>n\r\n   113\t\r\n   114\tCellar\r\n   115\t\r\n   116\tYour sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.\r\n   117\t\r\n   118\tn\r\n   119\t\r\n   120\tThe Troll Room\r\n   121\t\r\n   122\tThis is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole\r\n   123\tleading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\n   124\twalls.\r\n   125\t\r\n   126\tA nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of\r\n   127\tthe room.\r\n   128\t\r\n   129\tYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\n   130\t\r\n   131\tThe flat of the troll’s axe skins across your forearm.\r\n   132\t\r\n   133\t>slay troll\r\n   134\t\r\n   135\t(with the sword)\r\n   136\t\r\n   137\tYour sword misses the troll by an inch.\r\n   138\t\r\n   139\tThe axe sweens vast as uou"]
[374.925088, "o", " iump aside.\r\n   140\t\r\n   141\t>g\r\n   142\t\r\n   143\tYour sword crashes down, knocking the troll into dreamland.\r\n   144\t\r\n   145\t>g\r\n   146\t\r\n   147\tThe unarmed troll cannot defend himself: He dies.\r\n   148\t\r\n   149\t=== sample_006.png ===\r\n   150\tLiving Room Score: 54 Moves: 37\r\n   151\tYour sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.\r\n   152\t\r\n   153\t>se\r\n   154\t\r\n   155\tCyclops Room\r\n   156\t\r\n   157\tThis room has an exit on the northwest, and a staircase leading up.\r\n   158\t\r\n   159\tA cyclops, who looks prepared to eat horses (much less mere adventurers),\r\n   160\tblocks the staircase. From his state of health, and the bloodstains on the\r\n   161\twalls, you gather that he is not very friendly, though he likes people.\r\n   162\t\r\n   163\tYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\n   164\t\r\n   165\t>ulysse\r\n   166\t\r\n   167\tThe cyclops, hearing the name of his father’s deadly nemesis, flees the room\r\n   168\tby knocking down the wall on the east of the room.\r\n   169\t\r\n   170\tYour sword is no longer glowing.\r\n   171\t\r\n   172\t>e\r\n   173\t\r\n   174\tStrange Passage\r\n   175\t\r\n   176\tThis is a long passage. To the west is one entrance. On the east there is an\r\n   177\told wooden door, with a large opening in it (about cyclops sized).\r\n   178\t\r\n   179\t>e\r\n   180\t\r\n   181\tLiving Room\r\n   182\t\r\n   183\t>put all\r\n   184\t\r\n   185\t=== sample_007.png ===\r\n   186\tone wall. He is armed with a deadly stiletto.\r\n   187\t\r\n   188\tThere is a silver chalice, intricately engraved, here.\r\n   189\t\r\n   190\tThe butt of his stiletto cracks you on the skull, and you stagger back.\r\n   191\t>temple\r\n   192\t\r\n   193\tTemple\r\n   194\t\r\n   195\tThis is the north end of a large temple. On the east wall is an ancient\r\n   196\tinscription, probably a prayer in a long-forgotten language. Below the prayer\r\n   197\tis a staircase leading down. The west wall is solid granite. The exit to the\r\n   198\tnorth end of the room is through huge marble pillars.\r\n   199\t\r\n   200\tThere is a brass bell here.\r\n   201\t\r\n   202\t>d\r\n   203\t\r\n   204\tEgyptian Room\r\n   205\t\r\n   206\tThis is a room which looks like an Egyptian tomb. There is an ascending\r\n   207\tstaircase to the west.\r\n   208\t\r\n   209\tThe solid-gold coffin used for the burial of Ramses II is here.\r\n   210\t\r\n   211\tDopen solid\r\n   212\t\r\n   213\tThe gold coffin opens.\r\n   214\t\r\n   215\tA sceptre, possibly that of ancient Egypt itself, is in the coffin. The\r\n   216\tsceptre is ornamented with colored enamel, and tapers to a sharp point.\r\n   217\t\r\n   218\t>get shar\r\n   219\t\r\n   220\t=== sample_008.png ===\r\n   221\tLiving Room Score: 109 Moves: 54\r\n   222\tNorth of House\r\n   223\t>e\r\n   224\tBehind House\r\n   225\t>w\r\n   226\tKitchen\r\n   227\tOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\r\n   228\tA bottle is sitting on the table.\r\n   229\tThe glass bottle contains:\r\n   230\tA quantity of water\r\n   231\t>w\r\n   232\tLiving Room\r\n   233\tYour collection of treasures consists of:\r\n   234\tA jewel-encrusted egg\r\n   235\tA sword\r\n   236\tA painting\r\n   237\tA leather bag of coins\r\n   238\t>put solid\r\n   239\tWhat do you want to put the solid in?\r\n   240\t>case_\r\n   241\t\r\n   242\t=== sample_009.png ===\r\n   243\t>n\r\n   244\t\r\n   245\tMaintenance Room\r\n   246\t\r\n   247\tThis is what appears to have been the maintenance room for Flood Control Dam\r\n   248\t#3. Apparently, this room has been ransacked recently, for most of the\r\n   249\tvaluable equipment is gone. On the wall in front of you is a group of buttons\r\n   250\tcolored blue, yellow, brown, and red. There are doorways to the west and south.\r\n   251\tThere is a group of tool chests here.\r\n   252\t\r\n   253\tThere is a wrench here.\r\n   254\t\r\n   255\tThere is an object which looks like a tube of toothpaste here.\r\n   256\t\r\n   257\tThere is a screwdriver here.\r\n   258\t\r\n   259\t>push all\r\n   260\t\r\n   261\tgroup of tool chests: Pushing the group of tool chests isn’t notably helpful.\r\n   262\twrench: Pushing the wrench doesn’t seem to work.\r\n   263\t\r\n   264\ttube: Pushing the tube has no effect.\r\n   265\t\r\n   266\tscrewdriver: Pushing the screwdriver doesn’t seem to work.\r\n   267\t\r\n   268\tblue button: There is a rumbli"]
[374.925184, "o", "ng sound and a stream of water appears to burst\r\n   269\tfrom the east wall of the room (apparently, a leak has occurred in a pipe).\r\n   270\tred button: The lights within the room come on.\r\n   271\t\r\n   272\tbrown button: Click.\r\n   273\t\r\n   274\tyellow button: Click.\r\n   275\t\r\n   276\tThe water level here is now up to your ankles.\r\n   277\t\r\n   278\t>get too_\r\n   279\t\r\n   280\t=== sample_010.png ===\r\n   281\t>d\r\n   282\t\r\n   283\tDam Base\r\n   284\t\r\n   285\tYou are at the base of Flood Control Dam #3, which looms above you and to the\r\n   286\tnorth. The river Frigid is flowing by here. Along the river are the White\r\n   287\tCliffs which seem to form giant walls stretching from north to south along the\r\n   288\tshores of the river as it winds its way downstream.\r\n   289\t\r\n   290\tThere is a folded pile of plastic here which has a small valve attached.\r\n   291\t\r\n   292\t>get\r\n   293\t\r\n   294\t(pile of plastic)\r\n   295\t\r\n   296\tTaken.\r\n   297\t\r\n   298\t>u\r\n   299\t\r\n   300\tDam\r\n   301\t\r\n   302\t>w\r\n   303\t\r\n   304\tReservoir South\r\n   305\t\r\n   306\tYou are in a long room. To the north is a large lake, too deep to cross. You\r\n   307\tnotice, however, that the water level appears to be dropping at a rapid rate.\r\n   308\tBefore long, it might be possible to cross to the other side from here.\r\n   309\t\r\n   310\tThere is a path along the stream to the east or west, a steep pathway climbing\r\n   311\tsouthwest along the edge of a chasm, and a path leading into a canyon to the\r\n   312\tsoutheast.\r\n   313\t\r\n   314\t=== sample_011.png ===\r\n   315\t(crystal trident)\r\n   316\t\r\n   317\tTaken.\r\n   318\t\r\n   319\t>s\r\n   320\t\r\n   321\tReservoir North\r\n   322\t\r\n   323\tThere is a hand-held air pump here.\r\n   324\t\r\n   325\t>get\r\n   326\t\r\n   327\tChand-held air pump)\r\n   328\t\r\n   329\tTaken.\r\n   330\t\r\n   331\t>s\r\n   332\t\r\n   333\tReservoir\r\n   334\t\r\n   335\tLying half buried in the mud is an old trunk, bulging with jewels.\r\n   336\t>get\r\n   337\t\r\n   338\t(trunk of jewels)\r\n   339\t\r\n   340\tTaken.\r\n   341\t\r\n   342\t>s\r\n   343\t\r\n   344\tReservoir South\r\n   345\t\r\n   346\tThere is a folded pile of plastic here which has a small valve attached.\r\n   347\t>pump\r\n   348\t\r\n   349\tWhat do you want to pump up?\r\n   350\t\r\n   351\t=== sample_012.png ===\r\n   352\tReservoir South Score: 148 Moves: 88\r\n   353\tReservoir South\r\n   354\t\r\n   355\tThere is a folded pile of plastic here which has a small valve attached.\r\n   356\t>pump\r\n   357\t\r\n   358\tWhat do you want to pump up?\r\n   359\t\r\n   360\t>boat\r\n   361\t\r\n   362\tThe boat inflates and appears seaworthy.\r\n   363\t\r\n   364\tA tan label is lying inside the boat.\r\n   365\t\r\n   366\t>put all but lamp,pump\r\n   367\t\r\n   368\tWhat do you want to put the all but lamp , pump in?\r\n   369\t\r\n   370\t>boat\r\n   371\t\r\n   372\ttrunk of jewels: Done.\r\n   373\t\r\n   374\tcrystal trident: Done.\r\n   375\t\r\n   376\tscrewdriver: Done.\r\n   377\t\r\n   378\twrench: Done.\r\n   379\t\r\n   380\tsceptre: Done.\r\n   381\t\r\n   382\t>def late boat\r\n   383\t\r\n   384\tThe boat def lates.\r\n   385\t\r\n   386\t>get\r\n   387\t\r\n   388\t=== sample_013.png ===\r\n   389\tWhite Cliffs Beach Score: 158 Moves: 96\r\n   390\t>e\r\n   391\t\r\n   392\tDamp Cave\r\n   393\t\r\n   394\tThis cave has exits to the west and east, and narrows to a crack toward the\r\n   395\tsouth. The earth is particularly damp here.\r\n   396\t\r\n   397\t>e\r\n   398\t\r\n   399\tWhite Cliffs Beach\r\n   400\t\r\n   401\tYou are on a narrow strip of beach which runs along the base of the White\r\n   402\tCliffs. There is a narrow path heading south along the Cliffs and a tight\r\n   403\tpassage leading west into the cliffs themselves.\r\n   404\t\r\n   405\t>s\r\n   406\t\r\n   407\tWhite Cliffs Beach\r\n   408\t\r\n   409\tYou are on a rocky, narrow strip of beach beside the Cliffs. A narrow path\r\n   410\tleads north along the shore.\r\n   411\t\r\n   412\t>drpo boat\r\n   413\t\r\n   414\tI don’t know the word “drpo\".\r\n   415\t\r\n   416\t>drop boat\r\n   417\t\r\n   418\tDropped.\r\n   419\t\r\n   420\t>pump\r\n   421\t\r\n   422\t=== sample_014.png ===\r\n   423\tA crystal trident\r\n   424\tA trunk of jewels\r\n   425\tA tan label\r\n   426\t>e\r\n   427\tThe magic boat comes to a rest on the shore.\r\n   428\tShore, in the magic boat\r\n   429\tYou are on the "]
[374.925212, "o", "east shore of the river. The water here seems somewhat\r\n   430\ttreacherous. A path travels from north to south here, the south end quickly\r\n   431\tturning around a sharp corner.\r\n   432\tThe magic boat contains:\r\n   433\tA sceptre\r\n   434\tA wrench\r\n   435\tA screwdriver\r\n   436\tA crystal trident\r\n   437\tA trunk of jewels\r\n   438\tA tan label\r\n   439\t>get out\r\n   440\t(out of the magic boat)\r\n   441\tYou are on your own feet again.\r\n   442\t>n\r\n   443\t\r\n   444\t=== sample_015.png ===\r\n   445\tSandy Cave Score: 158 Moves: 109\r\n   446\t>get\r\n   447\t\r\n   448\t(shove 1)\r\n   449\t\r\n   450\tTaken.\r\n   451\t\r\n   452\t>ne\r\n   453\t\r\n   454\tSandy Cave\r\n   455\t\r\n   456\tThis is a sand-filled cave whose exit is to the southwest.\r\n   457\t>dig sand\r\n   458\t\r\n   459\tWhat do you want to dig the sand with?\r\n   460\t\r\n   461\t>shovel\r\n   462\t\r\n   463\tYou seem to be digging a hole here.\r\n   464\t\r\n   465\tgy\r\n   466\t\r\n   467\tThe hole is getting deeper, but that’s about it.\r\n   468\t\r\n   469\t>g\r\n   470\t\r\n   471\tYou are surrounded by a wall of sand on all sides.\r\n   472\t\r\n   473\t>g\r\n   474\t\r\n   475\tYou can see a scarab here in the sand.\r\n   476\t\r\n   477\t>drop\r\n   478\t\r\n   479\t=== sample_016.png ===\r\n   480\tShore Score: 168 Moves: 115\r\n   481\tOpening the red buoy reveals a large emerald.\r\n   482\t>get all\r\n   483\tred buoy: Taken.\r\n   484\tbeautiful jeweled scarab: Taken.\r\n   485\t>drop shovel\r\n   486\tDropped.\r\n   487\t>sw\r\n   488\tSandy Beach\r\n   489\t>s\r\n   490\tShore\r\n   491\tThere is a magic boat here.\r\n   492\tThe magic boat contains:\r\n   493\tA sceptre\r\n   494\tA wrench\r\n   495\tA screwdriver\r\n   496\tA crystal trident\r\n   497\tA trunk of jewels\r\n   498\tA tan label\r\n   499\t>put bar,emera\r\n   500\t\r\n   501\t=== sample_017.png ===\r\n   502\t>boat\r\n   503\t\r\n   504\tplatinum bar: Done.\r\n   505\t\r\n   506\tlarge emerald: Done.\r\n   507\t\r\n   508\t>get sharp\r\n   509\t\r\n   510\tTaken.\r\n   511\t\r\n   512\t>def late boat\r\n   513\t\r\n   514\tThe boat def lates.\r\n   515\t\r\n   516\t>get\r\n   517\t\r\n   518\t(pile of plastic)\r\n   519\t\r\n   520\tTaken.\r\n   521\t\r\n   522\t>s\r\n   523\t\r\n   524\tAragain Falls\r\n   525\t\r\n   526\tYou are at the top of Aragain Falls, an enormous waterfall with a drop of\r\n   527\tabout 450 feet. The only path here is on the north end.\r\n   528\t\r\n   529\tA beautiful rainbow can be seen over the falls and to the west.\r\n   530\t\r\n   531\twave sharp\r\n   532\t\r\n   533\tSuddenly, the rainbow appears to become solid and, I venture, walkable (1\r\n   534\tthink the giveaway was the stairs and bamnister).\r\n   535\t\r\n   536\t=== sample_018.png ===\r\n   537\tmarvelous view of the canyon and parts of the Frigid River upstream. Across\r\n   538\tthe canyon, the walls of the White Cliffs join the mighty ramparts of the\r\n   539\tFlathead Mountains to the east. Following the Canyon upstream to the north,\r\n   540\tAragain Falls may be seen, complete with rainbow. The mighty Frigid River\r\n   541\tflows out from a great dark cavern. To the west and south can be seen an\r\n   542\timmense forest, stretching for miles around. A path leads northwest. It is\r\n   543\tpossible to climb down into the canyon from here.\r\n   544\tnw\r\n   545\tClearing\r\n   546\tYou are in a small clearing in a well marked forest path that extends to the\r\n   547\teast and west.\r\n   548\t>w\r\n   549\tBehind House\r\n   550\t>wW\r\n   551\tKitchen\r\n   552\tOn the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\r\n   553\tA bottle is sitting on the table.\r\n   554\tThe glass bottle contains:\r\n   555\t\r\n   556\tA quantity of water\r\n   557\t>get s_\r\n   558\t\r\n   559\t=== sample_019.png ===\r\n   560\tLiving Room Score: 199 Moves: 134\r\n   561\t>get sack\r\n   562\tTaken.\r\n   563\t>open sack\r\n   564\tOpening the brown sack reveals a lunch, and a clove of garlic.\r\n   565\t>w\r\n   566\tLiving Room\r\n   567\tYour collection of treasures consists of:\r\n   568\tA gold coffin\r\n   569\tA jewel-encrusted egg\r\n   570\tA sword\r\n   571\tA painting\r\n   572\tA leather bag of coins\r\n   573\t>put sharp, pot, bug\r\n   574\tWhat do you want to put the sharp , pot , bug in?\r\n   575\t>case\r\n   576\tsceptre: Done.\r\n   577\tpot of gold: Done.\r\n   578\tbeautiful jeweled scarab: Done.\r\n   579\t>dr_\r\n   580\t\r\n   581\t=== sample_020."]
[374.925533, "o", "png ===\r\n   582\tLiving Room Score: 199 Moves: 136\r\n   583\tA leather bag of coins\r\n   584\t\r\n   585\t>put sharp, pot, bug\r\n   586\t\r\n   587\tWhat do you want to put the sharp , pot , bug in?\r\n   588\t\r\n   589\t>case\r\n   590\t\r\n   591\tsceptre: Done.\r\n   592\t\r\n   593\tpot of gold: Done.\r\n   594\t\r\n   595\tbeautiful jeweled scarab: Done.\r\n   596\t\r\n   597\t>drop all but pump\r\n   598\t\r\n   599\tbrown sack: Dropped.\r\n   600\t\r\n   601\tpile of plastic: Dropped.\r\n   602\t\r\n   603\tred buoy: Dropped.\r\n   604\t\r\n   605\tbrass lantern: Dropped.\r\n   606\t\r\n   607\t>pump\r\n   608\t\r\n   609\tWhat do you want to pump up?\r\n   610\t\r\n   611\t>boat\r\n   612\t\r\n   613\tThe boat inflates and appears seaworthy.\r\n   614\t\r\n   615\tA tan label is lying inside the boat.\r\n   616\t\r\n   617\t>get fork, trunk,b_\r\n   618\t\r\n   619\t=== sample_021.png ===\r\n   620\tLiving Room Score: 230 Moves: 138\r\n   621\t>pump\r\n   622\t\r\n   623\tWhat do you want to pump up?\r\n   624\t\r\n   625\t>boat\r\n   626\t\r\n   627\tThe boat inflates and appears seaworthy.\r\n   628\tA tan label is lying inside the boat.\r\n   629\t>get fork, trunk, bar,emeral\r\n   630\t\r\n   631\tcrystal trident: Taken.\r\n   632\t\r\n   633\ttrunk of jewels: Taken.\r\n   634\t\r\n   635\tplatinum bar: Taken.\r\n   636\t\r\n   637\tlarge emerald: Taken.\r\n   638\t\r\n   639\t>put all\r\n   640\t\r\n   641\tWhat do you want to put the all in?\r\n   642\t>case\r\n   643\t\r\n   644\tlarge emerald: Done.\r\n   645\t\r\n   646\tplatinum bar: Done.\r\n   647\t\r\n   648\ttrunk of jewels: Done.\r\n   649\t\r\n   650\tcrystal trident: Done.\r\n   651\t\r\n   652\thand-held air pump: Done.\r\n   653\t\r\n   654\t>get lamp,clove,sc\r\n   655\t\r\n   656\t=== sample_022.png ===\r\n   657\tTorch Room\r\n   658\t\r\n   659\tThis is a large room with a prominent doorway leading to a down staircase.\r\n   660\tAbove you is a large dome. Up around the edge of the dome (20 feet up) is a\r\n   661\twooden railing. In the center of the room sits a white marble pedestal.\r\n   662\tSitting on the pedestal is a flaming torch, made of ivory.\r\n   663\t\r\n   664\t>get\r\n   665\t\r\n   666\t(torch)\r\n   667\t\r\n   668\tTaken.\r\n   669\t\r\n   670\t>s\r\n   671\t\r\n   672\tTemple\r\n   673\t\r\n   674\tThere is a brass bell here.\r\n   675\t\r\n   676\t>get\r\n   677\t\r\n   678\t(brass bell)\r\n   679\t\r\n   680\tTaken.\r\n   681\t\r\n   682\t>s\r\n   683\t\r\n   684\tAltar\r\n   685\t\r\n   686\tOn the two ends of the altar are burning candles.\r\n   687\t\r\n   688\tOn the altar is a large black book, open to page 569.\r\n   689\t\r\n   690\t>get all\r\n   691\t\r\n   692\t=== sample_023.png ===\r\n   693\tEntrance to Hades Score: 244 Moves: 153\r\n   694\tThis is a tiny cave with entrances west and north, and a dark, forbidding\r\n   695\tstaircase leading down.\r\n   696\t>d\r\n   697\tEntrance to Hades\r\n   698\tYou are outside a large gateway, on which is inscribed\r\n   699\t\r\n   700\tAbandon every hope all ye who enter heret\r\n   701\tThe gate is open; through it you can see a desolation, with a pile of mangled\r\n   702\tbodies in one corner. Thousands of voices, lamenting some hideous fate, can be\r\n   703\theard.\r\n   704\tThe way through the gate is barred by evil spirits, who jeer at your attempts\r\n   705\tto pass.\r\n   706\t>drop pair\r\n   707\tDropped.\r\n   708\t>ring bell\r\n   709\tThe bell suddenly becomes red hot and falls to the ground. The wraiths, as if\r\n   710\tparalyzed, stop their jeering and slowly turn to face you. On their ashen\r\n   711\tfaces, the expression of a long-forgotten terror takes shape.\r\n   712\t>get\r\n   713\t\r\n   714\t=== sample_024.png ===\r\n   715\tLand of the Dead\r\n   716\t\r\n   717\tYou have entered the Land of the Living Dead. Thousands of lost souls can be\r\n   718\theard weeping and moaning. In the corner are stacked the remains of dozens of\r\n   719\tprevious adventurers less fortunate than yourself. A passage exits to the\r\n   720\tnorth.\r\n   721\t\r\n   722\tLying in one corner of the room is a beautifully carved crystal skull. It\r\n   723\t>get\r\n   724\t\r\n   725\t(crystal skull)\r\n   726\t\r\n   727\tTaken.\r\n   728\t\r\n   729\t>n\r\n   730\t\r\n   731\tEntuance ta Hsdoc\r\n   732\t\r\n   733\tDu\r\n   734\t\r\n   735\tCave\r\n   736\t\r\n   737\t>drop pair\r\n   738\t\r\n   739\tDropped.\r\n   740\t\r\n   741\tn\r\n   742\t\r\n   743\tMirror Room\r\n   744\t\r\n   745\tYou are in a large square room with tal"]
[374.925614, "o", "l ceilings. On the south wall is an\r\n   746\tenormous mirror which fills the entire wall. There are exits on the other\r\n   747\tthree sides of the room.\r\n   748\t\r\n   749\t=== sample_025.png ===\r\n   750\tSqueaky Room\r\n   751\t\r\n   752\tYou are in a small room. Strange squeaky sounds may be heard coming from the\r\n   753\tpassage at the north end. You may also escape to the east.\r\n   754\t\r\n   755\t>n\r\n   756\t\r\n   757\tBat Room\r\n   758\t\r\n   759\tYou are in a small room which has doors only to the east and south.\r\n   760\t\r\n   761\tIn the corner of the room on the ceiling is a large vampire bat who is\r\n   762\tobviously deranged and holding his nose.\r\n   763\t\r\n   764\tThere is an exquisite jade figurine here.\r\n   765\t\r\n   766\t>get\r\n   767\t\r\n   768\t(jade figurine)\r\n   769\t\r\n   770\tTaken.\r\n   771\t\r\n   772\t>e\r\n   773\t\r\n   774\tShaft Room\r\n   775\t\r\n   776\tThis is a large room, in the middle of which is a small shaft descending\r\n   777\tthrough the floor into darkness below. To the west and the north are exits\r\n   778\tfrom this room. Constructed over the top of the shaft is a metal framework to\r\n   779\twhich a heavy iron chain is attached.\r\n   780\t\r\n   781\tAt the end of the chain is a basket.\r\n   782\t\r\n   783\t>put torch,scr\r\n   784\t\r\n   785\t=== sample_026.png ===\r\n   786\tCoal Mine Score: 259 Moves: 183\r\n   787\tladder. To the west and the south are passages leaving the room.\r\n   788\t\r\n   789\tSomeone carrying a large bag is casually leaning against one of the walls\r\n   790\there. He does not speak, but it is clear from his aspect that the bag will be\r\n   791\ttaken only over his dead body.\r\n   792\t\r\n   793\t>s\r\n   794\t\r\n   795\tDead End\r\n   796\t\r\n   797\tYou have come to a dead end in the mine.\r\n   798\t\r\n   799\tThere is a small pile of coal here.\r\n   800\t\r\n   801\t>get\r\n   802\t\r\n   803\t(small pile of coal)\r\n   804\t\r\n   805\tTaken.\r\n   806\t\r\n   807\tn\r\n   808\t\r\n   809\tLadder Bottom\r\n   810\t\r\n   811\t>u\r\n   812\t\r\n   813\tLadder Top\r\n   814\t\r\n   815\t>u\r\n   816\t\r\n   817\tCoal Mine\r\n   818\t\r\n   819\t>\r\n   820\t\r\n   821\t=== sample_027.png ===\r\n   822\t>u\r\n   823\tSmelly Room\r\n   824\t>s\r\n   825\tShaft Room\r\n   826\tAt the end of the chain is a basket.\r\n   827\tThe basket contains:\r\n   828\tA screwdriver\r\n   829\tA torch (providing light)\r\n   830\t>put heap\r\n   831\tWhat do you want to put the heap in?\r\n   832\t>eage\r\n   833\tDone.\r\n   834\t>lower cage\r\n   835\tThe basket is lowered to the bottom of the shaft.\r\n   836\tPall\r\n   837\tSmelly Room\r\n   838\t>d\r\n   839\t\r\n   840\t=== sample_028.png ===\r\n   841\t>w\r\n   842\tTimber Room\r\n   843\tThis is a long and narrow passage, which is cluttered with broken timbers. A\r\n   844\twide passage comes from the east and turns at the west end of the room into a\r\n   845\tvery narrow passageway. From the west comes a strong draft.\r\n   846\tThere is a broken timber here.\r\n   847\t>drop all\r\n   848\tblack book: Dropped.\r\n   849\tclove of garlic: Dropped.\r\n   850\tbrass lantern: Dropped.\r\n   851\tWw\r\n   852\tDrafty Room\r\n   853\tThis is a small drafty room in which is the bottom of a long shaft. To the\r\n   854\tsouth is a passageway and to the east a very narrow passage. In the shaft can\r\n   855\tbe seen a heay iron chain.\r\n   856\tAt the end of the chain is a basket.\r\n   857\tThe basket contains:\r\n   858\tA small pile of coal\r\n   859\tA screwdriver\r\n   860\tA torch (providing light)\r\n   861\t>get all fr_\r\n   862\t\r\n   863\t=== sample_029.png ===\r\n   864\tMachine Room Score: 272 Moves: 207\r\n   865\tscrewdriver: Taken.\r\n   866\t\r\n   867\ttorch: Taken.\r\n   868\t\r\n   869\t>s\r\n   870\t\r\n   871\tMachine Room\r\n   872\t\r\n   873\tThis is a large, cold room whose sole exit is to the north. In one corner\r\n   874\tthere is a machine which is reminiscent of a clothes dryer. On its face is a\r\n   875\tswitch which is labelled “START”. The switch does not appear to be manipulable\r\n   876\tby any human hand (unless the fingers are about 1/16 by 1/4 inch). On the\r\n   877\tfront of the machine is a large lid, which is closed.\r\n   878\t\r\n   879\t>Dopen lid\r\n   880\t\r\n   881\tThe lid opens.\r\n   882\t\r\n   883\t>put heap\r\n   884\t\r\n   885\tWhat do you want to put the heap in?\r\n   886\t\r\n   887\t>lid\r\n   888\t\r\n   889"]
[374.925908, "o", "\tDone.\r\n   890\t\r\n   891\t>close lid\r\n   892\t\r\n   893\tThe lid closes.\r\n   894\t\r\n   895\t>set _\r\n   896\t\r\n   897\t=== sample_030.png ===\r\n   898\tTimber Room Score: 282 Moves: 213\r\n   899\t>get\r\n   900\t\r\n   901\tChuge diamond)\r\n   902\t\r\n   903\tTaken.\r\n   904\t\r\n   905\tPall\r\n   906\t\r\n   907\tDrafty Room\r\n   908\t\r\n   909\tAt the end of the chain is a basket.\r\n   910\t\r\n   911\t>put all\r\n   912\t\r\n   913\tWhat do you want to put the all in?\r\n   914\t\r\n   915\t>eage\r\n   916\t\r\n   917\thuge diamond: Done.\r\n   918\t\r\n   919\ttorch: Done.\r\n   920\t\r\n   921\tscrewdriver: Done.\r\n   922\t\r\n   923\t>e\r\n   924\t\r\n   925\tTimber Room\r\n   926\t\r\n   927\tThere is a brass lantern (battery-powered) here.\r\n   928\tThere is a clove of garlic here.\r\n   929\t\r\n   930\tThere is a black book here.\r\n   931\t\r\n   932\tThere is a broken timber here.\r\n   933\t\r\n   934\t>get _\r\n   935\t\r\n   936\t=== sample_031.png ===\r\n   937\tGas Room Score: 282 Moves: 221\r\n   938\t>e\r\n   939\t\r\n   940\tLadder Bottom\r\n   941\t\r\n   942\tThe lamp appears a bit dimmer.\r\n   943\t\r\n   944\t>u\r\n   945\t\r\n   946\tLadder Top\r\n   947\t\r\n   948\t>u\r\n   949\t\r\n   950\tCoal Mine\r\n   951\t\r\n   952\tn\r\n   953\t\r\n   954\tCoal Mine\r\n   955\t\r\n   956\t>e\r\n   957\t\r\n   958\tCoal Mine\r\n   959\t\r\n   960\t>s\r\n   961\t\r\n   962\tCoal Mine\r\n   963\t\r\n   964\t>n\r\n   965\t\r\n   966\tGas Room\r\n   967\t\r\n   968\tThere is a sapphire-encrusted bracelet here.\r\n   969\t>get_\r\n   970\t\r\n   971\t=== sample_032.png ===\r\n   972\tSqueaky Room Score: 287 Moves: 228\r\n   973\t>u\r\n   974\t\r\n   975\tSmelly Room\r\n   976\t\r\n   977\t>s\r\n   978\t\r\n   979\tShaft Room\r\n   980\t\r\n   981\tFrom the chain is suspended a basket.\r\n   982\t\r\n   983\traise cage\r\n   984\t\r\n   985\tThe basket is raised to the top of the shaft.\r\n   986\t\r\n   987\t>get huge, torch\r\n   988\t\r\n   989\thuge diamond: Taken.\r\n   990\t\r\n   991\ttorch: Taken.\r\n   992\t\r\n   993\tWw\r\n   994\t\r\n   995\tBat Room\r\n   996\t\r\n   997\tIn the corner of the room on the ceiling is a large vampire bat who is\r\n   998\tobviously deranged and holding his nose.\r\n   999\t\r\n  1000\t>s\r\n  1001\t\r\n  1002\tSqueaky Room\r\n  1003\t\r\n  1004\t>\r\n  1005\t\r\n  1006\t=== sample_033.png ===\r\n  1007\tA crystal trident\r\n  1008\t\r\n  1009\tA trunk of jewels\r\n  1010\t\r\n  1011\tA platinum bar\r\n  1012\t\r\n  1013\tA large emerald\r\n  1014\t\r\n  1015\tA beautiful jeweled scarab\r\n  1016\t\r\n  1017\tA pot of gold\r\n  1018\t\r\n  1019\tA sceptre\r\n  1020\t\r\n  1021\tA gold coffin\r\n  1022\t\r\n  1023\tA jewel-encrusted egg\r\n  1024\t\r\n  1025\tA sword\r\n  1026\t\r\n  1027\tA painting\r\n  1028\t\r\n  1029\tA leather bag of coins\r\n  1030\t>put all\r\n  1031\tWhat do you want to put the all in?\r\n  1032\t>case\r\n  1033\ttorch: Done.\r\n  1034\thuge diamond: Done.\r\n  1035\tsapphire-encrusted bracelet: Done.\r\n  1036\tclove of garlic: Done.\r\n  1037\tbrass lantern: Done.\r\n  1038\t>get egg, sword,1\r\n  1039\t\r\n  1040\t=== sample_034.png ===\r\n  1041\tThere is a silver chalice, intricately engraved, here.\r\n  1042\t\r\n  1043\tYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\n  1044\t\r\n  1045\tYou parry a lightning thrust, and the thief salutes you with a grim nod.\r\n  1046\tgive egg\r\n  1047\t\r\n  1048\t(to the thief)\r\n  1049\t\r\n  1050\tThe thief is taken aback by your unexpected generosity, but accepts the\r\n  1051\tjewel-encrusted egg and stops to admire its beauty.\r\n  1052\t\r\n  1053\t>kill man\r\n  1054\t\r\n  1055\t(with the sword)\r\n  1056\t\r\n  1057\tThe blow lands, making a shallow gash in the thief’s arm?\r\n  1058\t\r\n  1059\tYou parry a lightning thrust, and the thief salutes you with a grim nod.\r\n  1060\t>g\r\n  1061\t\r\n  1062\tThe blow lands, making a shallow gash in the thief’s armt\r\n  1063\t\r\n  1064\tThe thief stabs nonchalantly with his stiletto and misses.\r\n  1065\t\r\n  1066\tg\r\n  1067\t\r\n  1068\tThe thief is confused and can’t fight back.\r\n  1069\t\r\n  1070\tThe thief slowly regains his feet.\r\n  1071\t\r\n  1072\t>g\r\n  1073\t\r\n  1074\tThe thief is staggered, and drops to his knees.\r\n  1075\t\r\n  1076\t=== sample_035.png ===\r\n  1077\tThe thief is staggered, and drops to his knees.\r\n  1078\tThe thief slowly regains his feet.\r\n  1079\t>g\r\n  1080\tThe blow lands, making a shallow gash in the thief’s armt\r\n  1081\tThe thief tries to sneak past your guard, but you twist away.\r\n  1082\t>g\r\n  1083\tYour sword crashe"]
[374.92602, "o", "s down, knocking the thief into dreamland.\r\n  1084\t>g\r\n  1085\tThe unarmed thief cannot defend himself: He dies.\r\n  1086\tAlmost as soon as the thief breathes his last breath, a cloud of sinister\r\n  1087\tblack fog envelops him, and when the fog lifts, the carcass has disappeared.\r\n  1088\tAs the thief dies, the power of his magic decreases, and his treasures\r\n  1089\treappear:\r\n  1090\tA jewel-encrusted egg, with a golden clockwork canary\r\n  1091\tA stiletto\r\n  1092\tA jade figurine\r\n  1093\tA crystal skull\r\n  1094\tThe chalice is now safe to take.\r\n  1095\tYour sword is no longer glowing.\r\n  1096\t>get head, jade,cup,egg,go\r\n  1097\t\r\n  1098\t=== sample_036.png ===\r\n  1099\tForest Path Score: 319 Moves: 250\r\n  1100\tA crystal skull\r\n  1101\t\r\n  1102\tThe chalice is now safe to take.\r\n  1103\t\r\n  1104\tYour sword is no longer glowing.\r\n  1105\t\r\n  1106\t>get head, jade,cup,egg, golden\r\n  1107\t\r\n  1108\tcrystal skull: Taken.\r\n  1109\t\r\n  1110\tjade figurine: Taken.\r\n  1111\t\r\n  1112\tchalice: Taken.\r\n  1113\t\r\n  1114\tJjewel-encrusted egg: Taken.\r\n  1115\t\r\n  1116\tgolden clockwork canary: Taken.\r\n  1117\t\r\n  1118\t>temple\r\n  1119\t\r\n  1120\tTemple\r\n  1121\t\r\n  1122\t>s\r\n  1123\t\r\n  1124\tAltar\r\n  1125\t\r\n  1126\t>pray\r\n  1127\t\r\n  1128\tForest\r\n  1129\t\r\n  1130\t>e\r\n  1131\t\r\n  1132\tForest Path\r\n  1133\t\r\n  1134\t>wind canary\r\n  1135\t\r\n  1136\t=== sample_037.png ===\r\n  1137\tA leather bag of coins\r\n  1138\t>put all\r\n  1139\tWhat do you want to put the all in?\r\n  1140\t>case\r\n  1141\tbeautiful brass bauble: Done.\r\n  1142\tgolden clockwork canary: Done.\r\n  1143\tJjewel-encrusted egg: Done.\r\n  1144\tchalice: Done.\r\n  1145\tJjade figurine: Done.\r\n  1146\tcrystal skull: Done.\r\n  1147\tbrass lantern: Done.\r\n  1148\tsword: Done.\r\n  1149\tfn almost inaudible voice whispers in your ear, “Look to your treasures for\r\n  1150\tthe final secret.”\r\n  1151\t>e\r\n  1152\tKitchen\r\n  1153\tA bottle is sitting on the table.\r\n  1154\tThe glass bottle contains:\r\n  1155\tA quantity of water\r\n  1156\t>e_\r\n  1157\t\r\n  1158\t=== sample_038.png ===\r\n  1159\tThere is a small mailbox here.\r\n  1160\t\r\n  1161\tsw\r\n  1162\t\r\n  1163\tStone Barrow\r\n  1164\t\r\n  1165\tYou are standing in front of a massive barrow of stone. In the east face is a\r\n  1166\thuge stone door which is open. You cannot see into the dark of the tomb.\r\n  1167\t\r\n  1168\t>w\r\n  1169\t\r\n  1170\tInside the Barrow\r\n  1171\t\r\n  1172\tAs you enter the barrow, the door closes inexorably behind you. Around you it\r\n  1173\tis dark, but ahead is an enormous cavern, brightly lit. Through its center\r\n  1174\truns a wide stream. Spanning the stream is a small wooden footbridge, and\r\n  1175\tbeyond a path leads into a dark tunnel. Above the bridge, floating in the air,\r\n  1176\tis a large sign. It reads: All ye who stand before this bridge have completed\r\n  1177\ta great and perilous adventure which has tested your wit and courage. You have\r\n  1178\tmastered the first part of the ZORK trilogy. Those who pass over this bridge\r\n  1179\tmust be prepared to undertake an even greater adventure that will severely\r\n  1180\ttest your skill and bravery!\r\n  1181\t\r\n  1182\tThe ZORK trilogy continues with “ZORK II: The Wizard of Frobozz\" and is\r\n  1183\tcompleted in “ZORK III: The Dungeon Master.”\r\n  1184\t\r\n  1185\tYour score is 350 (total of 350 points), in 262 moves.\r\n  1186\t\r\n  1187\tThis gives you the rank of Master Adventurer.\r\n  1188\t\r\n  1189\tCNL\r\n  1190\t\r\n"]
