put all\r\n1032:>case\r\n1038:>get egg, sword,1\r\n1053:>kill man\r\n1060:>g\r\n1072:>g\r\n1079:>g\r\n1082:>g\r\n1084:>g\r\n1096:>get head, jade,cup,egg,go\r\n1106:>get head, jade,cup,egg, golden\r\n1118:>temple\r\n1122:>s\r\n1126:>pray\r\n1130:>e\r\n1134:>wind canary\r\n1138:>put all\r\n1140:>case\r\n1151:>e\r\n1156:>e_\r\n1168:>w\r\n"]
